Extra models for Holli Dance 1.6 (hollidance) from its author's site:
Holli's friends Renee, Susan and Penny and her new outfit (Holli Halter),
which appear in the Dancer menu, and the large kit: smoother versions of
the club and all dancers with about four times the polygons, a heavier
OpenGL load. Run "hollidance" for the standard models and dancers,
"hollidance -large" for the large ones.
